WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.241
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.511 --> 00:26.011
What’s that?

3
00:26.011 --> 00:29.014
Interior design for a coffee shop. Isn’t it obvious?

4
00:29.014 --> 00:32.059
You notice everything. Is something wrong?

5
00:32.059 --> 00:34.451
You’re just trying to distract yourself, aren’t you?

6
00:34.456 --> 00:37.037
Why? Do you want to die? Huh?

7
00:37.042 --> 00:38.043
Kill me!

8
00:38.605 --> 00:40.857
Do you have plans for later?

9
00:45.808 --> 00:46.892
Like a pro.

10
00:48.102 --> 00:49.895
Looks like you’re enjoying the company, huh?

11
00:49.895 --> 00:51.731
Well, well! You’ve got an answer for everything.

12
00:53.395 --> 00:55.481
What? You want more?

13
00:58.097 --> 00:59.432
Sorry!

14
01:00.206 --> 01:01.165
Shan?!

15
01:01.818 --> 01:03.611
I knew it, you fucker!

16
01:09.116 --> 01:12.035
Long time no see! Do you have a date?

17
01:13.672 --> 01:16.821
Now, the real question is... why aren’t you following me back?

18
01:17.586 --> 01:19.320
You’re too close.

19
01:19.328 --> 01:21.219
So, just how close can we get, Kierra?

20
01:21.227 --> 01:22.270
Are you going to tell me?

21
02:52.687 --> 02:53.688
Got a headache?

22
02:54.314 --> 02:55.940
It will be gone later.

23
02:56.274 --> 02:59.027
You know you should eat first and drink some water.

24
02:59.910 --> 03:00.785
I give up.

25
03:01.335 --> 03:01.794
Huh?

26
03:01.794 --> 03:03.522
I really can’t remember.

27
03:03.546 --> 03:04.922
Remember what?

28
03:05.860 --> 03:09.155
Luna, did you see any guy outside the restaurant when we went home?

29
03:12.046 --> 03:13.255
I don’t think so.

30
03:13.257 --> 03:15.593
We only saw you dead drunk.

31
03:24.187 --> 03:26.397
I really feel like I said something.

32
03:26.900 --> 03:27.985
What do you mean?

33
03:29.394 --> 03:30.353
Nothing.

34
03:32.210 --> 03:33.587
Just eat.

35
03:35.116 --> 03:36.534
I can’t.

36
03:40.637 --> 03:41.346
Hey!

37
03:43.278 --> 03:46.156
That’s what you get for drinking a lot. Geez.

38
03:56.820 --> 03:59.593
You know, Ke, don't think about us too much.

39
03:59.601 --> 04:01.226
We're fine, okay.

40
04:01.242 --> 04:03.018
You wish. As if I’d think about you.

41
04:04.023 --> 04:06.413
Master, stop bothering her.

42
04:06.421 --> 04:09.195
She might be trying to remember what she reviewed.

43
04:09.196 --> 04:11.407
Exactly, so annoying. Such an attention-seeker.

44
04:11.408 --> 04:13.243
Are you actually trying to remember what you reviewed?

45
04:14.617 --> 04:17.328
All right, get another barbecue. It’s on me.

46
04:18.195 --> 04:20.140
You too, Theo, so you’ll finally shut up.

47
04:20.140 --> 04:23.805
My buddy is so generous.

48
04:23.812 --> 04:25.093
Make it two.

49
04:25.109 --> 04:26.993
- Oh. - Huh?

50
04:27.000 --> 04:28.602
- Come on, get this one. - Okay. I thought—

51
04:28.609 --> 04:29.944
- you’ll eat it all. - Let’s take a picture.

52
04:30.515 --> 04:31.855
So I can post it.

53
04:31.867 --> 04:33.345
Wow. Haven’t eaten enough yet?

54
04:33.369 --> 04:34.429
But it’s your treat.

55
04:34.453 --> 04:35.329
Okay.

56
04:36.007 --> 04:37.360
One, two, hey!

57
04:37.375 --> 04:38.626
- Theo. One, two, three. - Oh!

58
04:40.074 --> 04:41.450
Okay.

59
04:42.585 --> 04:43.586
I’m uploading it, okay?

60
04:43.586 --> 04:46.339
Got free barbecue from this doofus.

61
04:46.339 --> 04:48.508
Hey, who are you calling a doofus? Give those back.

62
04:48.508 --> 04:50.510
Hey, no! Don’t! I’m just kidding.

63
04:50.510 --> 04:52.428
- Change that. - Yeah, I’ll change it now.

64
04:52.428 --> 04:53.280
See?

65
04:53.304 --> 04:55.181
Got free barbecue from this hottie.

66
04:55.181 --> 04:57.850
There you go. Hottie, that’s right.

67
04:59.313 --> 05:00.481
- Hottie. - Hottie?

68
05:01.010 --> 05:01.844
Move.

69
05:07.096 --> 05:09.015
- Here. - Sir, one more, please.

70
05:10.485 --> 05:11.686
I’ll treat this round too.

71
05:11.695 --> 05:15.592
I’m so lucky with my friends, they’re so generous!

72
05:15.616 --> 05:17.326
- How should I— - My guy is such a show-off.

73
05:17.326 --> 05:19.319
Want to be called a hottie, too, huh?

74
05:19.328 --> 05:21.655
You really don’t get enough attention, huh, Master?

75
05:21.656 --> 05:22.657
Don’t mind him.

76
05:22.657 --> 05:25.326
Let’s take a picture so I can post one of you, too.

77
05:28.091 --> 05:29.134
There.

78
05:36.718 --> 05:38.053
When did I follow him?

79
05:38.642 --> 05:39.310
Who?

80
05:39.888 --> 05:41.265
Ah. Nothing.

81
05:41.710 --> 05:42.210
It’s nothing.

82
05:42.953 --> 05:45.998
By the way, maybe you want to come with Sevi and me?

83
05:45.998 --> 05:49.008
We’re going to a coffee shop down the street.

84
05:49.015 --> 05:51.195
- I’ll treat you. - Yeah, it’s good there!

85
05:51.203 --> 05:53.289
- Coffee? - That’s why I’m telling her.

86
05:53.289 --> 05:54.206
- Sorry. - Let’s go.

87
05:54.206 --> 05:56.887
You guys go ahead. I still have somewhere to go.

88
05:56.911 --> 05:57.996
- You sure? - Mhmm.

89
06:07.008 --> 06:08.510
- Thank you, ma’am. - Thank you.

90
06:14.273 --> 06:16.312
Hello, Ma’am Kierra. Welcome back.

91
06:16.328 --> 06:17.872
Having your usual Americano?

92
06:17.890 --> 06:19.421
Ah. Yes, yes.

93
06:19.429 --> 06:22.645
Where’s Shan, the other barista? I just have something to ask.

94
06:22.646 --> 06:25.833
Oh, he's not here. He’s not on shift today.

95
06:25.856 --> 06:27.483
Ah, I see.

96
06:28.481 --> 06:30.442
Okay, let me prepare your coffee.

97
06:34.299 --> 06:35.342
Thank you, ma’am.

98
06:36.503 --> 06:38.232
One Sakura latte, please.

99
06:38.234 --> 06:40.984
Ma’am, sorry. We don’t have that on the menu.

100
06:40.992 --> 06:42.160
Ciandrei knows how to make it.

101
06:42.704 --> 06:44.081
He’s still not here right now.

102
06:47.351 --> 06:48.769
Uh…

103
06:48.769 --> 06:50.368
Okay, just an iced Americano then.

104
06:50.375 --> 06:51.523
One iced Americano.

105
06:51.524 --> 06:52.566
Okay, miss, coming right up.

106
07:05.050 --> 07:06.385
I wasn’t looking for him anyway.

107
07:07.010 --> 07:09.113
And you know, you guys should just fire him.

108
07:09.125 --> 07:10.210
He never comes in.

109
07:10.703 --> 07:12.516
So, one iced Americano, miss?

110
07:12.523 --> 07:13.148
Yup.

111
07:18.113 --> 07:19.156
Thank you.

112
07:36.395 --> 07:38.772
Looks like he’s really busy. He’s not showing up.

113
07:44.085 --> 07:47.641
Ke! Where are you? Let’s grab lunch in BGC?

114
07:55.599 --> 07:57.450
Are you okay, Ke?

115
07:57.460 --> 07:58.502
How’s it going?

116
08:01.430 --> 08:02.661
Oh…

117
08:02.664 --> 08:05.208
About Dr. Bautista?

118
08:07.895 --> 08:11.315
I don’t see her anymore.

119
08:15.218 --> 08:19.431
I know another doctor. Dr. Peja. Maybe she’d be better for you.

120
08:24.823 --> 08:26.867
Sam, do you know someone named Ciandrei?

121
08:28.298 --> 08:30.384
Ciandrei? Wait.

122
08:35.011 --> 08:37.763
Wait. Are you talking about him?

123
08:38.610 --> 08:41.696
Why? What’s with Shan? Is he flirting with you?

124
08:43.024 --> 08:45.025
He’s my friend but—

125
08:45.031 --> 08:47.992
You better be careful if you don't want your heart broken.

126
08:49.006 --> 08:51.972
Why? Is he really a red flag?

127
08:51.984 --> 08:53.304
Does he never run out of FWBs?

128
08:53.304 --> 08:57.350
I can’t answer that. All I know is he’s a walking heartbreak.

129
08:58.017 --> 09:00.579
You would think that he cares, but he doesn’t.

130
09:00.603 --> 09:02.609
Well, Shan is actually kind.

131
09:02.625 --> 09:04.502
But he is like that to everyone.

132
09:04.507 --> 09:07.051
But there’s no chance of commitment with him.

133
09:08.203 --> 09:09.537
Kind?

134
09:10.522 --> 09:11.717
Isn’t he leading them on?

135
09:12.344 --> 09:17.046
From what I heard, he tells them upfront that he doesn’t commit.

136
09:17.070 --> 09:19.716
But the girls still fall for him anyway.

137
09:19.740 --> 09:26.014
He gives off this vibe as if you know him, but the truth is you don’t.

138
09:26.038 --> 09:31.543
And you know what, he has walls around him that only his closest friends can enter.

139
09:38.926 --> 09:41.164
Why? Is he your type?

140
09:41.171 --> 09:42.832
No, yuck. He’s not.

141
09:42.856 --> 09:47.677
I just asked because I see him at the coffee shop, working as a barista.

142
09:48.339 --> 09:49.715
Oh, he owns that.

143
09:50.226 --> 09:51.894
He actually lives around the area.

144
09:51.894 --> 09:53.771
Girl, he’s super rich.

145
09:53.771 --> 09:55.356
He’s a Lopez-Ledezma.

146
09:56.390 --> 09:58.183
- What? - Mhmm.

147
10:01.375 --> 10:03.186
Speaking of the devil!

148
10:03.187 --> 10:05.147
Sam, you’re here.

149
10:05.898 --> 10:08.442
I wish you’d told me so I could treat you this time.

150
10:09.101 --> 10:10.936
Come on. It’s fine, Shan.

151
10:10.936 --> 10:13.522
Anyway, this is my friend, Kierra.

152
10:13.522 --> 10:15.274
Kierra, this is Shan.

153
10:20.487 --> 10:22.239
You're too close.

154
10:26.702 --> 10:28.745
So, how close can we get, Kierra?

155
10:30.425 --> 10:31.634
What should be our limit?

156
10:32.916 --> 10:34.126
You tell me.

157
10:38.202 --> 10:39.680
Should there be a limit?

158
10:40.515 --> 10:41.758
Crazy idea.

159
10:43.635 --> 10:46.221
I want to get to know you more.

160
10:49.698 --> 10:53.076
We’ve only spent a short time together, but you want to get to know me more?

161
10:53.809 --> 10:57.115
I don’t know much about you too, so there should be a limit.

162
10:57.730 --> 10:59.607
What do you want to know about me?

163
11:02.172 --> 11:03.172
Wait…

164
11:03.614 --> 11:05.582
Did I scare you with what I just said?

165
11:07.626 --> 11:14.257
That maybe I’d want to be in a relationship with you like your other girls?

166
11:17.371 --> 11:18.636
Don’t worry.

167
11:19.496 --> 11:24.335
I’m not even sure if I can love again anyway. So…

168
11:26.120 --> 11:27.413
There is a limit.

169
11:31.300 --> 11:32.594
Yeah.

170
11:32.601 --> 11:35.063
We know each other. Right, Kierra?

171
11:36.507 --> 11:39.761
Oh, shoot. I forgot I had an appointment.

172
11:39.761 --> 11:43.286
Shan, Ke, I’ll leave you two for now, okay?

173
11:43.296 --> 11:45.871
I need to go. Don’t worry, I’ll pay for everything.

174
11:45.875 --> 11:47.165
- Bye, I’ll call you. - Huh?

175
11:48.002 --> 11:49.462
Take care, take care.

176
11:49.462 --> 11:50.463
- Bye! - Sam, wait—

177
11:51.215 --> 11:52.175
Bye!

178
12:02.904 --> 12:03.780
Hi.

179
12:06.290 --> 12:07.416
Hello.

180
12:09.207 --> 12:14.985
About the other night, I can’t remember anything.

181
12:15.000 --> 12:18.713
If I said— If I said something, I didn’t mean it.

182
12:21.906 --> 12:23.576
You’re not a good liar, huh?

183
12:23.585 --> 12:25.033
I really don’t remember.

184
12:25.034 --> 12:26.411
Okay.

185
12:27.245 --> 12:29.747
But I’ve just been busy with law school,

186
12:29.747 --> 12:32.917
so I haven’t been able to visit the cafe lately.

187
12:34.127 --> 12:35.127
Who’s asking?

188
12:35.712 --> 12:37.672
You said you’re busy, but you can still party, huh?

189
12:38.216 --> 12:39.674
I saw it on your socials.

190
12:40.323 --> 12:42.241
That was my friend’s birthday.

191
12:42.874 --> 12:45.585
Also, thanks for following me back.

192
12:48.315 --> 12:50.150
I’ll follow you on IG.

193
12:51.013 --> 12:52.598
I’m following you.

194
12:56.604 --> 12:57.563
Right?

195
12:59.292 --> 13:00.251
Follow.

196
13:01.461 --> 13:02.461
I was drunk.

197
13:02.902 --> 13:03.861
It doesn’t count.

198
13:04.500 --> 13:07.711
I have a feeling you missed me.

199
13:07.736 --> 13:08.904
You wish.

200
13:11.052 --> 13:13.012
You seem busy, too.

201
13:13.907 --> 13:15.075
Busy with?

202
13:15.906 --> 13:17.046
Dating.

203
13:17.046 --> 13:18.499
Dating?

204
13:18.507 --> 13:19.550
With who?

205
13:20.512 --> 13:21.805
That’s not even part of my plan.

206
13:22.631 --> 13:26.820
I don’t know, maybe the one who treated you to barbecue?

207
13:26.845 --> 13:29.514
Or the one who treated you to kwek-kwek?

208
13:31.892 --> 13:37.147
But you know what, I know the one who treats you to froyo is even more handsome.

209
13:40.192 --> 13:41.067
Let’s go.

210
13:41.818 --> 13:43.153
Where are you taking me?

211
13:43.153 --> 13:44.571
We’re going on a date.

212
13:45.445 --> 13:46.071
Huh?

213
13:46.071 --> 13:47.445
Come on.

214
13:47.460 --> 13:48.155
Wait—

215
13:48.156 --> 13:48.991
Come on.

216
13:49.664 --> 13:50.206
To—

217
13:52.358 --> 13:53.901
I hope I got the right flavor now.

218
13:56.669 --> 13:59.129
Okay. You can ask me five questions.

219
13:59.129 --> 14:00.798
You can ask me anything.

220
14:02.984 --> 14:05.237
You own Yesterday’s Coffee?

221
14:06.947 --> 14:07.820
Yeah.

222
14:07.828 --> 14:08.682
How?

223
14:10.500 --> 14:11.918
It used to be my mom’s business.

224
14:12.544 --> 14:14.337
Eventually, it was transferred to me.

225
14:17.304 --> 14:20.460
Sam said you’re a Lopez-Ledezma.

226
14:21.011 --> 14:23.013
Why do you just use Lopez?

227
14:29.099 --> 14:31.393
They separated, my mom and Alf—

228
14:32.003 --> 14:33.922
I mean, my dad, when I was young.

229
14:34.910 --> 14:39.623
But since I lived with my mom, I used her surname.

230
14:43.499 --> 14:46.419
Why did you take psychology as your pre-law course?

231
14:48.796 --> 14:51.015
Because I’m interested in how the mind works.

232
14:51.023 --> 14:58.489
How emotions, feelings, and thoughts influence a person’s actions.

233
15:02.484 --> 15:05.789
That’s four. The next will be your last question.

234
15:05.796 --> 15:07.623
Think hard about it.

235
15:17.500 --> 15:18.835
Have we met before?

236
15:19.460 --> 15:20.753
Have we?

237
15:20.757 --> 15:24.344
I’m not sure. You know, the world is small anyway.

238
15:26.095 --> 15:30.183
So maybe we’ve already met.

239
15:35.929 --> 15:37.263
That’s mine, by the way.

240
15:37.263 --> 15:40.202
Sorry. I’ll just get a new straw—

241
15:40.210 --> 15:41.601
It’s okay.

242
15:41.609 --> 15:43.730
It’s not like we haven’t kissed before.

243
15:49.615 --> 15:50.741
Okay, how about this…

244
15:51.990 --> 15:53.536
Can I ask you questions now?

245
15:53.539 --> 15:55.122
Sure, five questions.

246
15:57.112 --> 15:58.238
First…

247
15:59.359 --> 16:03.447
Why were you alone the first day we met at Claremont Hotel?

248
16:04.700 --> 16:07.359
Second, why did you agree to have sex with me?

249
16:07.383 --> 16:08.467
I mean, look at you.

250
16:08.926 --> 16:12.179
You’re not the type of girl who just does that.

251
16:13.709 --> 16:15.461
I was sad back then.

252
16:16.757 --> 16:18.776
I just wanted to be brave that night.

253
16:18.781 --> 16:19.320
That’s it.

254
16:20.410 --> 16:23.329
And I regretted it the very next day.

255
16:23.968 --> 16:25.820
Why did you pay me that night?

256
16:26.937 --> 16:28.981
Did you think that was my side hustle?

257
16:28.981 --> 16:30.399
Huh?

258
16:31.687 --> 16:34.125
Can I order a breakfast for one?

259
16:34.126 --> 16:36.662
Can you charge it to Room 237?

260
16:37.656 --> 16:39.783
You idiot, that was for the food.

261
16:45.217 --> 16:45.968
Okay.

262
16:49.296 --> 16:50.548
Last question.

263
16:53.405 --> 16:54.365
Who is it?

264
16:57.126 --> 16:59.795
The person you see in your dreams.

265
17:04.120 --> 17:05.038
Look.

266
17:05.898 --> 17:08.233
You don’t have to answer if you’re not comfortable.

267
17:12.813 --> 17:13.898
My ex.

268
17:17.437 --> 17:18.897
That’s five questions.

269
17:23.506 --> 17:25.008
When’s your next shift?

270
17:26.712 --> 17:27.713
Wow.

271
17:28.404 --> 17:29.780
You miss me already?

272
17:33.968 --> 17:37.468
I guess you can have me back in a week, princess.

273
17:38.726 --> 17:39.978
I should go.

274
17:39.984 --> 17:41.652
How will you get home?

275
17:44.392 --> 17:45.768
Oh right.

276
17:49.303 --> 17:51.638
Come on, I'll take you home.

277
17:56.096 --> 17:59.057
It’s so early. You’ll take me to your condo, Ciandrei?

278
18:00.898 --> 18:02.582
That’s not what I mean.

279
18:02.593 --> 18:05.101
What I mean is, I’ll take you home to your place.

280
18:05.117 --> 18:08.224
But okay, if you wanna come home to my place, I mean, I'm still down for that.

281
18:09.088 --> 18:10.328
Do you wanna see my unit?

282
18:10.335 --> 18:11.169
I don’t want to.

283
18:11.169 --> 18:14.009
Why? Because it’s early, right?

284
18:14.560 --> 18:16.694
We could. We can stay here for a while until it gets dark.

285
18:16.703 --> 18:19.549
Or if you want, I can make you a Sakura latte while waiting.

286
18:20.194 --> 18:21.112
Damn it.

287
18:22.492 --> 18:23.618
Let’s go then.

288
18:23.618 --> 18:25.855
Is this how you invite your FWBs?

289
18:26.558 --> 18:27.518
Oh.

290
18:28.566 --> 18:30.401
For the record, this is the first time.

291
18:30.414 --> 18:34.335
And you're the first girl I've ever invited to my condo in BGC.

292
18:58.671 --> 18:59.797
Your mom?

293
19:01.095 --> 19:02.096
Yeah.

294
19:05.851 --> 19:08.729
The natural lighting here must be beautiful in the morning.

295
19:09.904 --> 19:11.447
To see is to believe.

296
19:12.188 --> 19:14.691
What if you stay here overnight so you can find out.

297
19:15.786 --> 19:17.454
You live here alone?

298
19:18.295 --> 19:19.338
Uhm—

299
19:20.207 --> 19:23.085
Technically I’m with you, so…

300
19:23.953 --> 19:26.416
That was a lame joke.

301
19:26.429 --> 19:28.707
I’m only here for the Sakura latte.

302
19:29.859 --> 19:33.237
What if you help me bake, too?

303
19:35.406 --> 19:37.033
You bake?

304
19:37.765 --> 19:40.377
That’s quite a reaction. Yeah.

305
19:40.382 --> 19:41.717
Do I look like I don’t bake?

306
19:41.717 --> 19:42.676
Yeah.

307
19:43.937 --> 19:47.561
You know, most of the pastries at the cafe are my recipes.

308
19:47.561 --> 19:52.171
We do have an in-house chef who does the in-house baking, but

309
19:52.195 --> 19:56.863
since I’ve gotten into baking too, I bake here from time to time for fun.

310
19:58.718 --> 20:01.929
For a fuck boy, I wouldn’t think you’d have soft hobbies.

311
20:07.383 --> 20:08.791
Here.

312
20:08.796 --> 20:10.084
Use my apron first.

313
20:30.688 --> 20:31.730
There. Can I see?

314
20:33.918 --> 20:34.937
It looks good on you.

315
20:35.900 --> 20:37.151
Do you have a crush on me?

316
20:37.731 --> 20:39.274
Is it that obvious?

317
20:40.281 --> 20:41.365
Liar.

318
20:41.796 --> 20:42.505
Okay.

319
20:42.878 --> 20:44.254
Let’s make the batter now.

320
21:10.695 --> 21:11.530
You can mix it now.

321
21:11.530 --> 21:12.239
- I’ll mix it? - Go, yeah.

322
21:12.239 --> 21:12.948
Okay.

323
21:16.066 --> 21:17.192
Am I doing it right?

324
21:31.921 --> 21:32.929
- Oh. - Oops.

325
21:41.296 --> 21:43.423
Do you really need to hold my hand?

326
21:45.525 --> 21:46.776
Unintentional.

327
21:49.484 --> 21:52.186
Just bake already. I want to eat cookies.

328
21:52.911 --> 21:54.204
I’ll mix it.

329
22:01.730 --> 22:03.569
You’re so messy.

330
22:03.578 --> 22:06.055
Seems like you’re the one who needs an apron. Wear this.

331
22:06.062 --> 22:07.414
No, no. It’s fine.

332
22:07.421 --> 22:08.505
I’ll just change. Hold on.

333
22:10.221 --> 22:11.097
Here—

334
22:30.492 --> 22:31.618
Why?

335
22:34.284 --> 22:35.284
Wow.

336
22:35.914 --> 22:38.792
It’s not like you haven’t seen this before.

337
22:41.085 --> 22:42.503
I’ll just change, okay?

338
23:11.515 --> 23:12.850
How much is this condo of yours?

339
23:14.515 --> 23:17.396
I actually don’t know because my mom bought this when it was cheap.

340
23:17.406 --> 23:21.320
So for sure the price has gone up a lot.

341
23:21.335 --> 23:23.624
Your mom is so business-minded.

342
23:23.632 --> 23:26.380
I’m sure she has a lot of investments that have turned profitable by now.

343
23:28.804 --> 23:29.805
What about you?

344
23:30.441 --> 23:32.568
Tell me about your family.

345
23:34.085 --> 23:34.952
Oh…

346
23:34.968 --> 23:38.148
Apologies, if you can’t answer the question, it’s okay.

347
23:38.156 --> 23:40.044
No, I’m good with my parents.

348
23:40.820 --> 23:43.327
My dad works for my uncle. He’s an artist.

349
23:43.351 --> 23:45.533
My mom owns a school. That’s it.

350
23:46.201 --> 23:47.202
That’s it.

351
23:47.991 --> 23:50.244
You, what about your family?

352
23:54.484 --> 23:56.710
It’s raining hard.

353
23:56.718 --> 23:58.678
Shit. How will I get home?

354
23:59.945 --> 24:01.816
You can wait out the rain here if you want.

355
24:01.835 --> 24:04.976
If you want, you can sleep here. I have a guest room anyway.

356
24:05.994 --> 24:11.867
And you can also play with my game console, but I have to go to my room.

357
24:11.882 --> 24:13.171
I need to study.

358
24:13.179 --> 24:14.828
Go ahead. Don’t mind me.

359
24:14.843 --> 24:16.511
I don’t want you to fail because of me.

360
24:17.700 --> 24:21.621
Nah, I have a feeling I’ll be studying inspired.

361
24:24.258 --> 24:26.803
You talk a lot. Go study already.

362
24:27.863 --> 24:29.198
I’ll be back.

363
24:52.000 --> 24:54.002
Oh shit! Luna.

364
24:54.633 --> 24:57.621
Where are you? It’s raining hard! Are you home yet?

365
25:00.835 --> 25:04.684
I ended up staying at Sam’s place. I’m sleeping here.

366
25:07.348 --> 25:10.101
I’m with Sam right now.

367
25:12.710 --> 25:14.221
Who are you with, huh?

368
25:14.226 --> 25:15.727
Is that your new boyfriend?

369
25:15.727 --> 25:17.187
You want me to beat him up?

370
25:19.765 --> 25:21.308
You’re such a dumbass, Ke.

371
25:21.859 --> 25:23.945
That’s the worst excuse ever.

372
25:24.791 --> 25:26.293
You’re gonna be in so much trouble when you get home.

373
26:40.706 --> 26:41.665
Shan?

374
26:46.905 --> 26:49.282
Oh. He fell asleep.

375
27:04.219 --> 27:05.429
Ciandrei.

376
27:09.620 --> 27:10.788
Okay.

377
27:12.891 --> 27:14.184
Five minutes.

378
27:55.872 --> 27:56.967
Good morning.

379
27:57.781 --> 28:00.742
Sorry, I fell asleep in your room.

380
28:02.109 --> 28:02.985
You know,

381
28:03.796 --> 28:07.998
it’s my first time sleeping over with a girl without ending up in the same bed as her.

382
28:09.732 --> 28:10.817
That’s fine.

383
28:11.812 --> 28:13.647
You slept so deeply.

384
28:14.314 --> 28:15.444
You were even snoring.

385
28:16.391 --> 28:17.809
Jerk! Seriously?

386
28:19.837 --> 28:22.493
Hey. Aren’t you— Are you serious?

387
28:23.198 --> 28:24.449
I’m just kidding.

388
28:26.328 --> 28:27.579
So annoying.

389
28:28.204 --> 28:31.666
But yeah, I really slept soundly.

390
28:36.421 --> 28:37.023
Let me help you.

391
28:37.031 --> 28:37.966
No, no. It’s okay.

392
28:37.968 --> 28:38.827
Just sit.

393
28:38.843 --> 28:41.218
This is almost done. This is the last one. Come on.

394
28:41.234 --> 28:43.445
I’ll just make you some coffee.

395
28:44.487 --> 28:47.073
You’ll make coffee for a barista?

396
28:47.073 --> 28:49.218
Excuse me, I know how to make coffee.

397
28:49.218 --> 28:52.388
Once you taste my coffee, maybe you’ll want to close down your cafe.

398
29:41.132 --> 29:42.967
Okay, fine. It’s not good. Stop drinking it.

399
29:42.967 --> 29:44.302
No, no. It’s fine.

400
29:45.409 --> 29:48.370
Maybe it was just a bad espresso shot.

401
29:48.370 --> 29:50.796
And your milk-steaming, maybe...

402
29:50.796 --> 29:55.301
it was a bit off but overall,

403
29:55.991 --> 29:56.867
decent.

404
29:57.915 --> 29:59.542
Thanks for the critique.

405
30:00.241 --> 30:03.994
Yeah, I’m never making coffee for a barista again.

406
30:07.609 --> 30:09.194
Oh shit! I need to go home.

407
30:09.820 --> 30:11.218
My cousin’s gonna kill me.

408
30:11.219 --> 30:12.780
I’ll take you home.

409
30:12.796 --> 30:14.398
No. No need.

410
30:14.405 --> 30:16.064
Are you sure?

411
30:16.070 --> 30:17.614
Okay then, how about this…

412
30:18.480 --> 30:20.190
I'll give you one condition.

413
30:20.957 --> 30:23.835
Meet me in Yesterday. 8PM, Wednesday.

414
30:25.011 --> 30:25.845
Fine.

415
30:26.513 --> 30:28.014
See you in Yesterday.

416
31:05.113 --> 31:06.327
Where were you?

417
31:06.351 --> 31:08.951
Why weren’t you answering my calls and messages?

418
31:09.646 --> 31:11.481
You met with your boyfriend, didn’t you?

419
31:15.002 --> 31:16.378
Well?

420
31:17.237 --> 31:18.363
Sorry.

421
31:19.195 --> 31:22.006
I just played with his game console.

422
31:22.023 --> 31:24.826
And then I fell asleep, no joke.

423
31:25.495 --> 31:27.288
Why didn’t you answer my call?

424
31:27.786 --> 31:28.954
My phone died.

425
31:29.601 --> 31:33.062
Can you stop asking me questions? I made it home alive, didn’t I?

426
31:33.070 --> 31:35.107
Okay, fine. Fine.

427
31:36.576 --> 31:38.995
Just please, tell me next time, okay?

428
31:40.726 --> 31:46.040
By the way, Sevi and Theo are inviting us to go to Antipolo on Wednesday.

429
31:46.064 --> 31:47.816
They found this good restaurant.

430
31:48.296 --> 31:49.422
Wednesday?

431
31:49.422 --> 31:50.382
Yeah.

432
31:50.382 --> 31:52.632
We’ll be done with school early anyway.

433
31:52.648 --> 31:54.734
I can’t. I have something to do.

434
31:56.213 --> 31:57.506
What do you have to do?

435
31:58.429 --> 31:59.221
Just something.

436
31:59.793 --> 32:02.587
What? What’s this, “just something”?

437
32:02.587 --> 32:04.297
You’re gonna be with your boyfriend, aren’t you?

438
32:04.297 --> 32:05.882
He’s not my boyfriend.

439
32:05.882 --> 32:07.500
He’s not your boyfriend?

440
32:07.507 --> 32:09.217
You’re meeting someone who’s not your boyfriend?

441
32:09.226 --> 32:10.227
You know, you—

442
32:10.227 --> 32:12.480
You ask so many questions, I said he’s not my boyfriend.

443
32:12.980 --> 32:14.023
Ke!

444
32:16.617 --> 32:18.035
Not your boyfriend? As if!

445
32:38.734 --> 32:40.711
Why am I trying to look nice?

446
32:40.726 --> 32:42.269
We’re just having coffee.

447
32:47.234 --> 32:50.404
I guess I can still look cute even if it’s just for coffee.

448
33:57.429 --> 34:01.684
Hi. I’m at the cafe already. Are you coming?

449
34:07.398 --> 34:09.381
Hi. Is this seat taken?

450
34:09.382 --> 34:10.300
Yeah, sorry.

451
34:25.021 --> 34:26.021
Where are you?

452
34:27.257 --> 34:29.275
Can you at least give me an update, please?

453
34:49.030 --> 34:50.088
Are we still meeting up?

454
36:28.484 --> 36:30.069
I strangled him.

455
36:35.096 --> 36:37.348
I didn’t even realize how tightly I’d held him.

456
36:39.785 --> 36:42.162
And how did you come back to your senses?

457
36:42.782 --> 36:43.825
Nothing.

458
36:44.694 --> 36:47.030
Someone came, so I let go.

459
36:51.630 --> 36:53.423
I don’t want to be like him.

460
36:54.092 --> 36:55.260
Your father?

461
36:59.123 --> 37:04.128
I feel like I’m so scared right now of becoming like him.

462
37:05.103 --> 37:08.857
To the point where I can’t sleep at night thinking about it.

463
37:10.992 --> 37:12.744
I don’t wanna be like him.

464
37:14.878 --> 37:16.714
I don’t wanna hurt anyone.

465
37:21.593 --> 37:23.721
I don’t want to hurt her.

466
37:24.502 --> 37:27.339
Her, your sister?

467
37:29.007 --> 37:31.134
I would never hurt my sister,

468
37:33.499 --> 37:35.376
but she’s not who I’m talking about.

469
37:40.297 --> 37:41.673
I met someone.

470
37:51.900 --> 37:53.484
A beautiful girl.

471
37:55.202 --> 37:56.787
And she wants to get to know me.

472
37:58.898 --> 38:00.900
And that scares you?

473
38:05.408 --> 38:07.743
I don’t want her to see this side of me.

474
38:09.380 --> 38:10.965
I’m sure she’ll stay away.

475
38:17.597 --> 38:20.141
I just want to apologize for what happened.

476
38:21.848 --> 38:23.225
I know I hurt you.

477
38:23.714 --> 38:26.842
That was a long time ago, Shan. We’re fine now, aren’t we?

478
38:26.842 --> 38:28.260
What’s wrong with you?

479
38:28.925 --> 38:30.176
Yeah, I know but—

480
38:30.176 --> 38:32.386
You’re feeling guilty, aren’t you? Why?

481
38:33.202 --> 38:35.079
Are you already in love with someone?

482
38:40.644 --> 38:42.070
You’re in love, bro.

483
38:42.647 --> 38:44.124
Bro, chill.

484
38:44.128 --> 38:45.963
Me? Fall in love?

485
38:46.910 --> 38:47.909
Never.

486
38:48.336 --> 38:50.370
You know what, that’s what everyone’s been saying.

487
38:51.101 --> 38:52.644
But that’s just not me.

488
38:54.104 --> 38:59.300
I mean, for you to go out of your way to apologize

489
38:59.308 --> 39:01.766
to every girl you’ve hurt before.

490
39:03.614 --> 39:06.116
I’m sensing you’re afraid of karma.

491
39:08.486 --> 39:11.322
All right, all right. Whatever you say, bro.

492
39:11.969 --> 39:12.720
Bye.

493
39:13.305 --> 39:14.556
Okay.

494
39:15.113 --> 39:17.324
Okay. Just call me anytime as always.

495
39:17.324 --> 39:19.409
Bye, lover boy.

496
39:25.341 --> 39:26.405
And maybe…

497
39:27.145 --> 39:28.397
Maybe it’s right.

498
39:30.003 --> 39:32.003
Maybe it’s right that she shouldn’t know me.

499
39:33.156 --> 39:35.450
Why do you say that, Shan?

500
39:36.413 --> 39:40.527
Cause if I’m like this, I’m no good for her.

501
39:41.415 --> 39:44.043
Shan, you made a mistake once,

502
39:44.809 --> 39:47.902
but that doesn’t mean you’re like your dad now.

503
39:49.190 --> 39:51.991
Just the fact that you’re here means that you’re

504
39:51.995 --> 39:54.557
actively doing something to not be like him.

505
39:55.288 --> 39:59.084
You can’t avoid everyone who wants to get to know you.

506
40:02.474 --> 40:04.393
Why don’t you give this a chance?

507
40:09.193 --> 40:11.195
Give yourself a chance.

508
40:35.699 --> 40:36.992
Sweet dreams.

509
40:38.180 --> 40:39.682
No nightmares tonight.

510
41:07.886 --> 41:10.847
Shan, why are you afraid to open up?

511
41:14.449 --> 41:16.761
Who was that guy the other night?

512
41:16.769 --> 41:18.925
How did you meet that person from Taft?

513
41:18.925 --> 41:21.206
How did you know he went to Taft?

514
41:21.214 --> 41:23.995
This happened before Kalix...

515
41:24.003 --> 41:26.255
Ke! I’m so sorry, Ke!

516
41:28.152 --> 41:29.207
Let me make it up to you.

517
41:29.214 --> 41:30.924
And then are you just going to stand me up again?

518
41:32.503 --> 41:34.492
You can say you’re not ready yet.

519
41:34.503 --> 41:37.116
You know, if he truly cares about you, he’ll wait.

520
41:37.803 --> 41:40.598
You can ask the other person that you need more time.

521
41:44.815 --> 41:45.733
Are you going to see him?

522
41:47.232 --> 41:48.775
Are you sure? Are you ready?

523
41:50.019 --> 41:51.105
Sorry, Ke—

524
41:51.113 --> 41:52.469
I’m just going to the restroom.

525
41:52.472 --> 41:54.429
- I’ll be right back. - Okay.

526
41:54.433 --> 41:55.888
Shan! Are you on a date?

527
41:55.894 --> 41:58.433
Who is she? Introduce me.

528
41:58.437 --> 42:02.433
I think you should introduce me to your new partner, don’t you think?
